Winders: Sink quickly{PAGE}{COLOR:03}Lures shaped like fish:{/COLOR}
Toppers: Don't sink much
Minnow: Sink when wound{PAGE}{COLOR:04}Lifelike Lures:{/COLOR}
Froggers: Don't sink much
Worm: Sink quickly{/SPEED}

